#   - Transactional > Settings > Webhooks  (eventos de status: sent, delivered, bounced...)
#   - Inbound Parsing > Settings           (respostas dos leads chegando por email)
# O token e validado via header x-webhook-token, Authorization Bearer ou query ?token=.
